# The build context is the repo root (both services need packages/dxb-core),
# so keep the heavy, irrelevant, and secret paths out of it.
.git
.env
data/
docs/
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/uv.lock

# ui/'s own build artifacts — node_modules especially: hundreds of MB that
# would otherwise be sent to the Docker daemon on every build even though
# ui/Dockerfile runs its own `npm ci` in a clean image. dist/ is rebuilt
# inside the image too, never copied in from the host, so a stale local
# build can't leak into what gets shipped.
ui/node_modules
ui/dist
ui/coverage
